ind":"announcement","title":"1000 wishlists!! & what's in store after Next Fest","summary":"Wow, it's actually bonkers that this many people have looked at our game and decided \"hey that's worth giving a shot\".Something that was once a pipe dream has spread into something with global reach in over 60 countries. It's an honour and privilege to be entertaining people from all around the world, and we cannot thank this community enough for your support.We've all grown up playing games that have stuck with us, and it's wild to think that we're on the other side of that now and some kid mig","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T07:53:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041386","verified_at":"2026-10-25T11:28:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053270-1846651706692613","game_id":"steam-5053270","kind":"announcement","title":"Mithril | Full Demo Playthrough","summary":"Watch the whole Mithril demo, live all Next FestWe’ve recorded a complete run of the Mithril demo, from the first collapse through to Dormancy, and it’s playing on loop right here on the store page for all of Next Fest.What you’ll seeDigging through a fully destructible voxel worldCave-ins: mine carelessly and the rock comes down on youBuilding furnaces, belts and automationLava, water and the things that live in the darkLike what you see?The demo is free to play right now. Try it yourself, and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T20:18:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692613","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053270-1846651706686843","game_id":"steam-5053270","kind":"announcement","title":"Combat Abilities, Cozy Mode, and more","summary":"Combat Abilities, Cozy Mode, and more | 18 Oct 2026New Combat AbilitiesYou can now manipulate the stone to fight back.Fault Line collapses a portion of the roof on nearby enemies and stuns them. Rock Wall raises pillars to block enemies; attack it to hurl its boulders for extra damage. Rock Wedge knocks enemies back. Parry to block attacks and deflect damage back at enemies. Cave collapses now also damage enemies. Use them to your advantage.Cozy Mode & World SettingsChoose how punishing your wor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T12:15:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686843","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053270-1846651706673906","game_id":"steam-5053270","kind":"announcement","title":"Improved quests, physics, and more","summary":"Improved quests, physics, and more | 14 Oct 2026Cave Collapses / Physics OverhaulPhysics now behave a little more, mining the floor for example no longer collapses the roof unless there's a clearer direct connection to the mined area. Cracks now much more reliably show what is at risk of falling. Struts support the stress points around them more reliably.Improved Quest ChainThe opening quest chain has been redesigned for smoother onboarding, including additional quests.Here’s a list of all the c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T10:42:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673906","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053270-1846018067938593","game_id":"steam-5053270","kind":"announcement","title":"Seven New Languages, Smoother Frames, and more","summary":"Seven New Languages, Smoother Frames, and more | 12 Oct 2026Seven New LanguagesMithril is now available in Ukrainian, Turkish, Traditional Chinese, Hungarian, Korean, Polish and Italian. Language selection now applies live in game, no restart needed.Performance OverhaulDramatically reduced RAM usage and increased FPS across the board, especially on low to mid range machines. Improved framerate during long game sessions.Dormancy & Earth's HeartFixed a problem where Dormancy wasn't triggering prop","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T14:27:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938593","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053270-1846018067926596","game_id":"steam-5053270","kind":"update","title":"Massive Localisation Update","summary":"Language Localisation - 9 new languagesNow available in:EnglishFrenchGermanSpanish - SpainJapanesePortuguese - BrazilRussianSimplified ChineseSpanish - Latin AmericaSpecial thanks to everyone for waiting while we got this done. We're so glad you can now experience Mithril in your native languages!♡ C&T | Agentic Games","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T15:40:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926596","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053270-1846018067924906","game_id":"steam-5053270","kind":"announcement","title":"Major System: Research Tree","summary":"Ancient Knowledge, the Emberweaver, and moreNew Major System: Ancient KnowledgeThe Research Bench building is open for business. Ancient Knowledge, sealed in the rock, is waiting for you to uncover new talents for mining, crafting and survival.New Boss: The EmberweaverSomething stirs in the lava. The Emberweaver has come.New Ore Grades and Vein TiersOre that comes down in a cave collapse now drops Low Grade ore. High Grade ore is found in dense veins and via talents, and is used in high end mach","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T03:50:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067924906","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053270-1844115010489592","game_id":"steam-5053270","kind":"announcement","title":"New game type: Chaos Mode","summary":"Amongst fixing all the many bugs in Mithril (wasps and spiders notwithstanding), we figured while we're at it, let’s add a new game mode. One that seems to describe how we’re developing at the moment.Chaos Mode brings with it greatly enhanced cave stress and a far easier triggerable collapse system. Start the game with increased mining speed and radius. It will not help.Here’s a list of all the changes this patch:Heavily dialled up cave stress levels in base game and added Chaos Mode (even more ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T16:11:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010489592","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053270-1843481262691133","game_id":"steam-5053270","kind":"update","title":"Major Demo Update: The Armory + more","summary":"We've added a bunch more fixes based on your feedback, so thank you to all who are helping shape Mithril in these early demo days! AND, biggest of all, we're bringing in a new system.Introducing the ArmoryA unique structure with upgrade trees and socketing systems for mining and combat. Different ingots will now give you stat boosts based on their type and socket location. Players can now customise how they want to play - increase mining radius, lifesteal, increase chance to find gems, and many ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T04:51:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262691133","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053270-1842846814451880","game_id":"steam-5053270","kind":"announcement","title":"More Demo Updates","summary":"We've heard your feedback and have loved watching everybody enjoy their first taste of Mithril, but there's even more to see! We've implemented a few more fixes and additions to improve player experience!Water physics now interacts with cave-insRecipe ingredient changes and reductions, specifically Earth's HeartEarth's Heart now costs significantly less to get you towards your first Dormancy!Additional quests & modified original questlineImproved crafting & automation interactionsAnd just a remi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T00:17:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451880","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053270-1842846814448707","game_id":"steam-5053270","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Minor Updates","summary":"We've heard your feedback from the first rendition of the demo and have implemented a few fixes to improve player experience!Copper Strut crafting recipe ingredients reducedLodelight added as quest reward for Dare to Delve DeeperAdditional triggers for craft a Lodelight optional objectiveAdditional triggers for Dare to Delve Deeper questDramatically increased crafting speedAdded objective tracking HUD for quest Webs on the Walls (spider nests)Thank you to all the testers and feedback we have rec","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T09:19:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814448707","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053270-1842846814448221","game_id":"steam-5053270","kind":"announcement","title":"Mithril Demo LIVE Now","summary":"What's in it:Learn the caves: Mine with claws. Every material has real physical properties that change how it breaks and what it gives up, including the roof.Support the ceiling: Every stone bears weight. Take too much, too fast, and it all comes down. Master placing your struts to help carry the load.Build the chain: Orehands move your ore while you keep digging. Dig by hand, then build machines that process it for you.Trigger Dormancy: A million years of geology simulated in a moment. Manipula","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T00:53:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814448221","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:03:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5053270-1841579228678865","game_id":"steam-5053270","kind":"announcement","title":"Official Gameplay Trailer is Live","summary":"Mithril's Gameplay Trailer has just dropped ahead of our free demo launch later this week early September 2026!In the demo you can expect a taste of all you see in the trailer. Mining, building, surviving the caves and creatures within them. Then, trigger Dormancy, fast forwarding time and geology. Same cave, but different. Free, playable, and the first time anyone outside the studio gets to dig.Thank you for all the support to get this far!With the demo drop comes a never ending stream of updat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T16:44:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_co